; Print a spoken line
;
; Prints "<subject> say "<HL message>"." from the messages #R$B009, then the
; message in HL, then #R$B00F. Sets the capital flag (#R$B704) first so the
; speech starts with a capital letter.
;
; HL Message address of the words spoken
@label=PrintSpeech
c$A1E3 PUSH HL
 $A1E4 LD HL,$B009
 $A1E7 CALL $72DD
 $A1EA POP HL
 $A1EB LD A,$01
 $A1ED LD ($B704),A     ; capital flag
 $A1F0 CALL $72DD
 $A1F3 LD HL,$B00F
 $A1F6 JP $72DD
